# over loot/ (the profile, importer, worth, outcome and planner: plan/31
# Stage 1), on the same terms as hunt.rs.
crates/cena-behavior/src/loot.rs 100
# NEW SPLIT PARENT, 2026-09-24. crates/cena-model/src/state/ledger.rs is the
# loot classifier's facade (plan/34 Stage 1): the LootFact/Find/Appraiser/Buyer
# enums, `classify` and the per-chunk cursor, with the readers in ledger/. It is
# 298 lines at birth, most of them the documented enum; 350 leaves room for a
