crates/cena-model/src/state/ledger.rs 350
# NEW SPLIT PARENT, 2026-09-24. crates/cena-session/src/ledger.rs is the loot
# ledger's facade (plan/34 Stage 2): the Ledger, its Live memory and the
# transaction; the arms are in ledger/write.rs and the thread in
# ledger/worker.rs. 183 lines at birth; 250 leaves room for a method, not an arm.
crates/cena-session/src/ledger.rs 250
